<h3>Temporary Limits</h3>
<p>To maintain fast and reliable Catalog access, we have turned on a limit on search length and number of terms for users who are not logged in or on Penn State's computers and VPN. This helps reduce automated bot traffic that was impacting system performance and availability.</p>

<p>By reserving more complex searches for logged-in users and those on Penn State's VPN and IP addresses, we can continue to provide robust and dependable access to materials held by the Penn State Libraries.</p>

<p>If you would like to continue with current search, please log in. If you are not affiliated with Penn State, please construct a shorter query. We apologize for the inconvenience, and appreciate your understanding as we work to ensure the best experience for all users.</p>
